/*.err
/*.gd.uid
/.preview*
/.check*

# === Security & Exclusion Rules (no assets, json, keystores, or secrets) ===
assets/
**/assets/
*.json
**/*.json
*.keystore
*.jks
*.key
*.p12
*.pem
key.properties
**/key.properties
keystore_credentials*
admob_secrets.gd
admob_secrets.gd.uid
admob_secrets.cfg
admob_secrets.json
.godot/
build/
*.aab
*.apk
